    {
      "sort_order": 1,
      "title_en": "Sports and Hobbies",
      "body_en": "One rainy Saturday, Thawan sat by the window. \"I have nothing to do,\" he said.\n\nOllie flew in. \"Let us find you a new hobby!\"\n\nFirst, Thawan tried reading. He read three chapters of a big book. Then he tried drawing and painting. He painted a blue dinosaur with green spots.\n\nThe rain stopped, so they went outside. Thawan took photographs of birds. At the pond, he went fishing and caught a silver fish.\n\nAt the park, he ran on the track. Then he climbed to the top of a big rock.\n\n\"I love all these hobbies!\" said Thawan. \"Which one should I choose?\"\n\n\"You do not have to choose,\" said Ollie. \"You can do them all!\""
    },
    {
      "sort_order": 2,
      "title_en": "The Fashion Show",
      "body_en": "Nong Fah was cleaning her closet. Clothes were everywhere!\n\nOllie and Thawan came to help. \"Let us have a fashion show!\" said Ollie. They made a runway in the living room.\n\nFirst Nong Fah wore a pink dress with white socks and shiny shoes. Then she wore a blue skirt and a yellow t-shirt.\n\nThawan wore his best shirt and dark pants. For a cold day, he put on a warm sweater, a heavy coat, and a soft hat.\n\nFor the beach, Nong Fah wore sandals.\n\n\"That was the best fashion show ever!\" said Ollie.\n\n\"Now,\" said Nong Fah, \"we must hang all these clothes back up!\""
    },
    {
      "sort_order": 3,
      "title_en": "Counting Around Town",
      "body_en": "One sunny morning, Ollie and Nong Fah walked around town. \"Let us count the things we see,\" said Ollie.\n\nThey saw one cat on a fence. Then they saw three more cats in a garden.\n\nIn the park, two dogs were playing. At the library, tall shelves were full of books.\n\nOn the street, Nong Fah counted seven cars. Three buses waited at the bus stop.\n\nIn the pet shop window, five puppies played together. At the playground, many children were running.\n\n\"So many things!\" said Nong Fah. \"One and many!\""
    }
  ],
